KNOWNBUG
named_port_connection6.sv
--bound 0
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^file .* line .*: syntax error, .*$
--
named_port_connection in parser.y only accepts
'.' any_identifier '(' expression_opt ')', so the implicit named port
connection shorthand ".clk_i" (1800-2017 A.4.1.1, equivalent to
".clk_i(clk_i)") is rejected as a syntax error rather than accepted as
an ordinary named connection to a same-named identifier.
